          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "There’s been a lot of speculation about where we stand on open-weights models. We’ve outlined our views in full here:  https:// anthropic.com/news/position- open-weights-models …",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2081880400872284480",
