        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "CHINA’S KIMI K3 HAS SURPASSED ALL AMERICAN MODELS IN FRONT-END CODING WHILE BEING SMALLER THAN MOST CLOSED-SOURCE FRONTIER MODELS.  Great work by the  @Kimi_Moonshot  team.",
