          "timestamp": "2026-07-18T04:30:58.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 1997
        },
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "My conclusion so far is that Kimi K3 may be the first model to narrow the gap with leading U.S. closed-source models to less than three months.",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2077900642396549537",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-17T07:38:13.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 1573
        },
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "U.S. EYES TOUGHER CURBS ON CHINESE AI  THE TRUMP ADMINISTRATION IS REPORTEDLY CONSIDERING STRICTER RULES ON CHINESE AI MODELS AFTER THE LAUNCH OF MOONSHOT AI’S KIMI K3. OPTIONS INCLUDE REQUIRING U.S. HOSTING PROVIDERS TO GUARANTEE THE SECURITY OF CHINESE MODELS AND ACCEPT",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2079158754382389551",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-20T18:57:30.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 1436
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "State of AI Models",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2076853976876597495",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-14T10:19:08.000+08:00",
