        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "BofA’s Vivek Arya made an excellent point, which I’d like to share.  Is open-source AI bearish for memory?  Closed models amortize global demand across shared HBM pools concentrated in a handful of data centers, whereas open models create a new memory footprint with every",
