          "timestamp": "2026-07-22T15:32:27.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 950
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Successfully training models on TPUs has been demonstrated by Anthropic through the past five-plus successful Claude releases. This is positive for the ML community, as Google TPUs continue to gain market share outside of internal Google workloads, giving frontier AI labs a",
